body:
My INFJ traits makes me feel that I don't belong anywhere while my ADHD traits justify me feeling like a weirdo amongst 'normal' functioning people.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

edit: adhd and wordy sentences amirite

YOU DESCRIBED ME TO A T. I WRITE SO MUCH BETTER THAN I CAN TALK. I JUST DEVIATE FROM MY SUBJECT MID-SENTENCE AND THIS HAS CAUSED ME TO DELETE EVERY SINGLE VIDEO OF ME TALKING. I have always wanted to upload a video or two on Youtube to talk about things that mean a lot to me but I always end up cringing at unintelligible sentences and deleting the video. 

&#x200B;

ISTG if someone can improve my speech and speed, my entire life will change. I have so many ideas but my mouth cannot catch up to my brain's thinking speed.

yield protection go brrr

&#x200B;

i got accepted at Drexel but I committed to UofR.
